{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1000_p", "source_sha256": "543d8f2182b56344b9262a93040edd53d493f3bfbf587e6ab223006beb5a3f07", "ja": "（さて、そろそろ定期公演の打ち合わせだな。\n今回は紗代子の新曲をお披露目する予定だけど……）", "zh": "（那么，差不多该开定期公演的筹备会了。\n这次计划要首次公开纱代子的​​新歌，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "a59a222c2a99b82bb407416fddf026cf12c2ec8c990c992f01a83aad6b63d586", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nちょうどよかったね、琴葉ちゃん。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你来得正好，琴叶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "b9b45379b1f316d62df919ef57982e97dee89c068bca682071ac17a5973be49a", "ja": "はい。お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n今から、公演のミーティングですよね？", "zh": "好的。辛苦了，{$P$}。\n现在要开公演会议了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6f8e9eb17a2e98bffec467773359ee53896bbe5833c0f997a0b5eb88c4cfb8da", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。\nふたりとも、今回の公演もよろしく頼む！", "zh": "啊，没错。\n这次的公演也拜托你们两位了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "bd7eae14f1f480e125149d9a7f500f70bfe807d60453707a3105412b7dd1497f", "ja": "はいっ、まかせてください♪\n紗代子ちゃんたち、もう来てるかなぁ？", "zh": "好的，交给我吧♪\n紗代子她们已经来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "d46eb44376d162c198806ad14b254c998d3d52160eb1a5abd39bbaeed42751ae", "ja": "さっき連絡があったので、もう来てると思います。\nあ、ほら。控え室のほうから、声が……。", "zh": "刚才联系过了，我想她们应该已经到了。\n啊，你看。从休息室那边传来了声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "d9e3ac7d3438f4657973002854d8d305d6cbcbb70137f706aa0138721e28888c", "ja": "ええ～～～っ！？", "zh": "诶诶～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "d9e3ac7d3438f4657973002854d8d305d6cbcbb70137f706aa0138721e28888c", "ja": "ええ～～～っ！？", "zh": "诶诶～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "4f04583667551f7f49d11a94b59b0ccfc181a368d4fe9d6c3c650efd7aeb067c", "ja": "じゃあ麗花さん、\n受験の最中に、鉛筆を転がしてたんですか？", "zh": "那么，丽花姐，\n你考试的时候还在转铅笔吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "a3b7c04478089f2a113255adfcbe6420d02ec8b5cd97c055a9aa60b6d6868b0a", "ja": "うん！　どうしてもわからない問題の時は、\n鉛筆をコロコロ～って転がして……。", "zh": "嗯！遇到实在不会的题目时，就把铅笔滚ROCO来滚去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "4f53ffb54b2a35fe169a1618696109eff46af8942c515f8997d984d8036ea59b", "ja": "それで、えいや！って答えを書いてたよ♪", "zh": "然后就喊一声“嘿呀！”写下答案了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "82296b5afa63bb37f32393f4fafeb49aa9838f80072ddf3574ddaf99f12d6f68", "ja": "さすが麗花ちゃん、肝が据わってるわね……。\n私はとてもじゃないけど、そんな余裕なかったわ。", "zh": "不愧是丽花，真是沉得住气啊……\n我可完全没有那种从容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "9bd99f68e404dd5fca74002b380b200ff2e336c4247d9e30683d4e019d880d0d", "ja": "はい、私もです……わからない問題も、とにかく\n最後の１秒まで全力で取り組む！って感じでした。", "zh": "是啊，我也是……就算遇到不会的问题，也总之要拼尽全力做到最后１秒！就是这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1013_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1014_p", "source_sha256": "32c25b3b34f5b9c572ddc761b28382a435e0ebebe190f5e8c30c7336fadd8dd2", "ja": "お疲れさま。お、3人とも揃ってるな。", "zh": "辛苦了。哦，3人都到齐了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "41ac2e191e85303a784b284ab7de04bc5f22be87b522fd80b48e086462825aa1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\n春香さんと琴葉さんも、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n春香小姐和琴叶小姐也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "a68bde93832467b8ff12fb5c5092e43dd71ab13023d93572e60f120ff0ff9f44", "ja": "お疲れさまです♪　みんなの楽しそうな声、\n廊下まで聞こえてきてたよ！", "zh": "辛苦了♪大家开心的声音，连走廊都听得见哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "9e6e74f459d06416cc862f34afbd2fd9038b1779d5daca3c2ad00686fa72ef09", "ja": "ふふ、ごめんなさい！　今、紗代子ちゃんが出演した\nCMの話をしていたの。ほら、あの学習塾の……。", "zh": "呵呵，抱歉！刚才我们正在聊纱代子出演的那支广告。就是那家补习班的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "01dfe65561445abc7b69b8819c641056472428f22a60d663ca7931403df551e1", "ja": "ああ、あのCM……たしかに、印象に残りますよね。\n紗代子の新曲も、イメージどおりで。", "zh": "啊，那支广告……确实让人印象深刻呢。\n纱代子的新歌也很符合她给人的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a9d484a84c721a1d7bb2a635c9acb182924557316033f922d54a4c474fd3c197", "ja": "みんなチェック済みなら、話が早いな。\nさっそくだけど、定期公演の打ち合わせを始めよう！", "zh": "既然大家都已经看过了，那就好办了。\n事不宜迟，我们马上开始定期公演的碰头会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1021_p", "source_sha256": "84470d42c5f88478c18e7a129a2bc8c5b5a702614d33899d96f951ffec0c46c2", "ja": "まず。事前に話していた通り……\n次の公演では、紗代子の新曲が初披露になる。", "zh": "首先。正如之前谈到的那样……\n在下次公演中，将会首次公开纱代子的新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3f18744d06ab1e97b63db5a03ce79c110f972dfb96162c3ff5f4019702448986", "ja": "今回の新曲はタイアップとして、サビの部分が既に、\n紗代子が出演した塾のCMで先出しされている。", "zh": "这次的新歌作为联动曲，副歌部分已经在纱代子出演的补习班广告中率先公开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "c8d3ccb7ca52b15262f98055be1d20104190a84f8b5169623b77d7a816691323", "ja": "力強くてまっすぐで、素敵な曲でしたね！\n紗代子ちゃんにぴったりだなって。", "zh": "这首歌既有力量又很直率，真是首很棒的歌呢！我觉得特别适合紗代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ba4e36169933b5a9b7c457f9e060eef914ec4cf8c03ba5d12c2aabd62d749821", "ja": "CMも曲も、早くも好評みたいだ。\n塾や制作会社の人たちから、お礼の連絡があったって。", "zh": "广告和歌曲好像都迅速收获了好评。\n听说补习班和制作公司那边，都发来了致谢联络。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "e2dcdd2411fbb9f3c08c8d43d08b9603924f8788954c1af1f700d73ab8de67fa", "ja": "そうなんですか！？　わぁ、うれしいな……\nがんばった甲斐がありました！", "zh": "是这样吗！？哇，真开心……\n努力没有白费！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "f529535c004d4e36297d3d1a67b2ab58a92d4caa3de71d2836a2644ab2406cb9", "ja": "でもでも、せっかくだからフルで聴きたいな～。\n{$P$}さん、音源はないんですか？", "zh": "不过不过，难得有这个机会，我想听完整版的～。\n{$P$}先生，没有音源吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1027_p", "source_sha256": "404e11ffbd3fe2b12995e052600583068901502b5c355e42ce2db7ec691a5bba", "ja": "そうだな。それじゃ、せっかくだから……", "zh": "是啊。既然难得有这个机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "c4367ed33f72dbf3c5d17c546ee0a2d4a8ef0ed5f0e086820bd652ca41cc2fd5", "ja": "こうして改めて聞いても、やっぱり素敵な曲ですね。\n疾走感があるっていうのかな……紗代子らしいな。", "zh": "像这样重新听一遍，果然还是首很棒的歌呢。\n该说是有种疾驰感吗……很有紗代子的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "e0d98a5df9b4e87141a790094d51122a2af118db56d13096fc2ab241a1a9c2e3", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね！　本番でお客さん達に聞いて\nもらうのが楽しみね、紗代子ちゃん。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊！真期待正式演出时让客人们听到呢，纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b34eaa3500e3cea38c260bbb31f209710dbc7c98e9bb5ee613671538b63540c8", "ja": "CMで流れているとはいえ、ほんの一部だしな。\nお客さんは、公演で初めて全体を聞くことになる……。", "zh": "虽然在广告里放过，但也只有一小部分。\n观众们要在演出中，才会第一次听到完整版……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1033_p", "source_sha256": "982bca3c21f76058238ec721adf3d8a04113298acfc814429abd713ef9b7f615", "ja": "今まで以上に新曲への期待が高まっていると\n思うが、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "我觉得大家对新歌的期待比以往更高了，你还应付得来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "d8a5c90ea9bb255a989e210e2528f40e6ae20db318f07c6df22ff4f559991ea4", "ja": "はい、当然です！　気合いを入れて、\n全力でレッスンしようと思います！", "zh": "是的，这是当然的！我会打起精神，全力投入练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1035_p", "source_sha256": "bb4cdcba2f654c1e5c5fc801c543375dc2f4f0506a62487e9169dec089ad1d95", "ja": "うん、いい意気込みだ。\nそれじゃみんな、本番まで頑張ろう！", "zh": "嗯，干劲不错。那大家，一起努力到正式演出吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1036_027say", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_080_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
